Definitely MS670 memory, the -BP is 32MB and the -CF is 64MB.  The last 
letter in this part number (L4001-Bx or L4001-Cx) designates the vendor 
of the components on the module.  The MS670 memory only works on the 
"original" VAX4000 models with the old backplane.

